{"id": "safehouse-client-stipends-and-housing-loan", "title": "SafeHouse reported $29,400 taken from a state grant for client stipends", "seconds": 73.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "tempo": 1.038, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "01c8abcdcf4323f6", "words": 180, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The sponsor reported that an employee took state grant money from the client stipend account.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.22, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["What", "happened", "to", "the", "stipends?"], "sub": "San Francisco SafeHouse"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.63, 1.11, 1.29, 1.39, 2.12, 2.44, 2.81, 3.14, 3.41, 3.57, 3.68, 4.13, 4.56]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The sponsor reported 29,400 dollars taken.", "t0": 5.34, "t1": 9.53, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "State grant account", "heading": "Reported amounts", "source": "review", "rows": [{"icon": "transfer", "label": "Stipends taken", "value": "$29,400"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "Employee repayment", "value": "$3,900"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.81, 1.31, 1.99, 2.6, 2.93, 3.22, 3.67]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The employee repaid 3,900 dollars.", "t0": 9.65, "t1": 12.9, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Employee repayment"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.74, 1.26, 1.56, 2.06, 2.36, 2.67]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The sponsor replaced the client funds.", "t0": 13.02, "t1": 15.21, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Sponsor replaced the stipends"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.81, 1.26, 1.36, 1.71]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "The sponsor said it terminated the employee and filed a police report and an insurance claim.", "t0": 15.33, "t1": 20.92, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "updated", "kicker": "San Francisco Budget and Legislative Analyst", "text": "Fiscal monitoring", "mark": "Fiscal monitoring"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.72, 0.95, 1.06, 1.67, 1.79, 2.73, 3.05, 3.43, 3.5, 3.85, 4.37, 4.61, 4.71, 5.18]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "On October 13 the Controller placed the sponsor in Tier 2 after four unresolved findings.", "t0": 21.04, "t1": 27.81, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Four unresolved findings"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.67, 1.64, 1.81, 2.3, 2.61, 2.71, 3.23, 3.37, 3.74, 4.4, 4.8, 5.29, 6.08]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The City separately proposed a loan for acquisition and rehabilitation of 23 housing units.", "t0": 28.03, "t1": 34.12, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "housing", "kicker": "San Francisco Mayor’s Office of Housing and Community Development", "text": "Housing loan proposal", "mark": "Housing loan proposal"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.58, 1.13, 1.68, 1.77, 2.09, 2.27, 2.88, 3.02, 4.47, 4.66, 5.25, 5.66]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The loan combined housing bond funds and bridge financing.", "t0": 34.24, "t1": 37.61, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Proposed financing", "heading": "Two sources", "source": "housing", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Housing bond funds", "value": "$15 million"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Bridge financing", "value": "$850,000"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.49, 0.99, 1.4, 1.72, 2.17, 2.31, 2.66]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The 2024 monitoring report arrived five months late.", "t0": 37.73, "t1": 41.74, "shot": "underwriting", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "monitor", "kicker": "Monitoring", "text": "Five months late", "mark": "Five"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.57, 1.17, 1.75, 2.35, 2.95, 3.33, 3.66]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "compare", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "For 2025, the city calendar says June first. The loan review says June thirtieth.", "t0": 41.86, "t1": 48.72, "shot": "report-calendar", "visual": {"type": "compare", "rows": [["Project calendar", "June 1, 2026"], ["Underwriting review", "June 30, 2026"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 1.11, 1.36, 2.31, 2.45, 2.7, 3.11, 3.43, 3.78, 4.68, 4.88, 5.18, 5.65, 5.98, 6.31]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The city called for a reporting plan three months before construction completion.", "t0": 48.84, "t1": 53.32, "shot": "condition", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Three months before completion"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.47, 0.84, 0.97, 1.06, 1.55, 2.21, 2.6, 2.97, 3.31, 3.88]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The proposed loan was up to 15.85 million dollars.", "t0": 53.44, "t1": 57.75, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$15.85 million", "label": "Proposed housing loan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.74, 1.06, 1.24, 1.38, 1.53, 2.23, 2.6, 2.94, 3.38, 3.77]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "On November 18 the Budget and Finance Committee recommended the loan.", "t0": 57.87, "t1": 61.63, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "docket", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "November 18", "mark": "November 18"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.55, 1.21, 1.4, 1.71, 1.82, 2.24, 2.64, 3.19, 3.31]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The Clerk listed a December 1 Board packet.", "t0": 61.75, "t1": 64.75, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "December 1 Board packet"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.65, 1.13, 1.22, 1.81, 2.24, 2.55]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The November 25 record does not establish final Board approval or disbursement.", "t0": 64.87, "t1": 69.71, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Final Board action", "Loan draws"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.56, 1.1, 1.65, 1.94, 2.21, 2.78, 3.11, 3.31, 3.82, 4.14]}, {"scene": "housing", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 69.83, "t1": 72.38, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.89, 1.07, 1.36, 1.44, 1.54, 1.8, 2.09]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The stipend account", "housing": "A separate housing proposal"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "contrast"}